    <item>
      <title>Sukkiri 0.11.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:02:36 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Updates itself from now on: broom menu &gt; Check for Updates…</li><li>Won&#x27;t paste Google Docs text that still has suggestions, and tells you why</li><li>Paste clean is now ⌃⌥⇧⌘V (Hyper+V); paste original stays ⌃⌥⌘V</li><li>Runs on macOS 14 or later</li></ul>]]></description>
